WEBVTT

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.563
like this one, and where you come from,

00:15:02.563 --> 00:15:07.532
Europe and so forth, who have influence
and who have freedom to speak and to act,

00:15:07.532 --> 00:15:12.558
need to take the responsibility
on yourselves

00:15:12.558 --> 00:15:15.623
to be more forceful in demanding

00:15:15.623 --> 00:15:20.265
an end to racial discrimination
against girls and women

00:15:20.265 --> 00:15:21.626
all over the world.

00:15:21.626 --> 00:15:24.527
The average woman in Egypt

00:15:24.527 --> 00:15:26.693
doesn't have much to say
about her daughters

00:15:26.693 --> 00:15:30.101
getting genitally mutilated and so forth.